{#
  The page of an entry whose content type is built with blocks (Theme > Single Layouts > Edit template): the blocks of the type's
  template, drawn for this entry by BlockRenderer (page_blocks). Entry title, Entry text, Fact sheet and Entry blocks are the blocks
  that draw parts of the entry; any other block can show its fields. The header sits over the page when the template opens with
  an Entry title and the entry asks for it, as it does on the standard page.
#}
{% extends 'layouts/base.twig' %}
{% set title_header = page_blocks.lead.type|default('') == 'entry-title' %}

{% block content %}
  {{ page_blocks.html|raw }}
{% endblock %}
